{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51385","headline":"寄家书 · 李德谷","name":"寄家书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"琼与中原隔，自然音信疎。\n天涯无去雁，船上有回书。\n一别五年外，相思万里余。\n开缄更多感，老泪湿霜须。\n（《光绪崖州志》二一《艺文》（周建国云：李德裕大中元年贬崖州，三年冬卒。\n「别五年外」之「五「当作「三」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51385.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51385","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}